<div class="ocean-instructions-board">
  <div id="instructions-title">Python Puzzle 2</div>
  <div id="instructions-body">Calculate ticket costs for adults and children.
Ask how many adult and child tickets with input().
Multiply by the prices, add for the total.
Print each subtotal and the total formatted to 2 decimals.</div>
  <div id="instructions-given">ADULT_PRICE = 11.50
CHILD_PRICE = 8.25</div>
  <div id="instructions-expected-label">Sample Run:</div>
  <div id="instructions-expected">Adult tickets: 2
Child tickets: 3
Adults: $23.00
Children: $24.75
Total: $47.75</div>
